The terminal icon faces in pwa/src/shared/ui/fonts
(symbols-nerd-font-bmp.woff2, symbols-nerd-font-mdi.woff2) are subsets of
Symbols Nerd Font from Nerd Fonts v3.5.1,
https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts, Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre,
MIT License (pwa/src/shared/ui/fonts/LICENSE-nerd-fonts.txt). They hold glyphs
from Codicons and Font Awesome (CC BY 4.0), Material Design Icons (Apache 2.0),
Pomicons and Weather Icons (SIL OFL 1.1), Devicons, Font Awesome Extension,
IEC Power Symbols, Octicons, Powerline Extra Symbols and Seti-UI (MIT), Font
Logos (Unlicense) and Powerline Symbols. pwa/src/shared/ui/fonts/README.md
lists each set with its licence and how the files were made.
